on\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature\/shapeCollectionWithShapes:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"shapeCollectionWithShapes:"}],"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapecollectionfeature\/shapecollectionwithshapes:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNFillStyleLayer":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNFillStyleLayer","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnfillstylelayer","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNFillStyleLayer","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFillStyleLayer","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFillStyleLayer"},{"text":" is a style layer that renders one or more filled (and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"optionally stroked) polygons on the map.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPolyline":{"fragments":[{"text":"MLNMultiPolyline","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNMultiPolyline","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipolyline","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolyline"},{"text":" object represents a shape consisting of one or more","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"polylines. For example, you could use a multipolyline shape to represent both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sides of a divided highway (dual carriageway), excluding the median (central"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reservation): each carriageway would be a distinct "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolyline"},{"type":"text","text":" object."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolyline"}}}